  "reference": "Embandizo 30",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raheli kayaboine atazalira Yakobo baana, ahagika omurumuna, agambira Yakobo ati, “Ompe abaana anga nfe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amunigalira, agamba ati, “Inye naba Ruhanga kukwima oruzaro?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raheli amugambira ati, “Omuzana wange Bilia ngugu; orare nawe anzalire abaana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amumuha aba mukaziwe, arara nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bilia atwara enda azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raheli agamba ati, “Ruhanga yandamulira, yahulira n'eiraka lyange yantunga omwana w'obwojo.” Eibara amuruka Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bilia ashuba atwara enda, azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo owa kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raheli agamba ati, “Nfukaine na murumuna wange n'amani mara namusinga.” Aho aruka omwana eibara Nafutali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea kayaboine yalekera kuzara, akwata omuzanawe Zilipa amuha Yakobo aba mukaziwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zilipa azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea agamba ati, “Buberwa.” Eibara amuruka Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zilipa azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo wa kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea agamba ati, “Byera bitai! Abakazi baranyeta Byera.” Eibara amuruka Asheri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu makiro g'okugesha engano Rubeni agenda abona entongo omw'ishwa, aziletera nyina. Aho Raheli agambira Lea ati, “Ninkushaba ompeho entongo za mutabani wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Lea amuhorora ati, “Iwe kunyaka ibanye? Mbwenu otware n'entongo z'omwana wange?” Raheli amugambira ati, “Ompe entongo za mutabani wawe, kir'eki Yakobo arare owawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo bwaigoro Yakobo yarugire omw'ishwa, Lea ashohora kumuchwekera, amugambira ati, “Oije owange, nakukodi entongo za mutabani wange.” Aho kir'ekyo arara nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ahulira Lea, atwara enda azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo wa katanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea agamba ati, “Ruhanga yantunga emperwa yange aha rw'okuba mpaire ibanye omuzana wange.” Omwana amuruka eibara Isakari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea atwara enda azalira Yakobo omwana w'obwojo owa mukaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho agamba ati, “Ruhanga yantunga egabo nungi, mbwenu ibanye arankunira, enshonga namuzalira abaana b'abojo mukaga.” Nikwo kumuruka eibara Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma azara omwisiki amuruka eibara Dina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga aijuka Raheli, amuhulira, amuha oruzaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atwara enda azara omwana w'omwojo, agamba ati, “Ruhanga yanyihyaho enshoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuruka eibara Yozefu nagamba ati, “Omukama anyongere omwana w'obwojo ondijo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raheli orwo yabaire yazaire Yozefu, Yakobo agambira Labani ati, “Ontaishure ngaruke owaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompe abakazi bange n'abaana bange abo ntura ninkolera ngende; aha rw'okuba na iwe nomanya omulimo ogwo ntura ninkukolera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Labani ahorora ati, “Leka nkugambire ekigambo eki: Mbalize namanya okwo Omukama antungire omugisha aha rw'enshonga yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gamba emperwa yawe ngikuhe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amugambira ati, “Iwe wenene nomanya okwo ntura ninkukolera, n'okwo ebitunganwa byawe bibaire ahali inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okaba oina bike ntakaizire, nawe mbwenu bikanyire byaba ekinje; mara Omukama akakuha omugisha mbali nahindukiraga hona hona. Kyonkai mbwenu ndamanya maki eka yange?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubaza ati, “Nkuheki?” Yakobo amuhorora ati, “Otampa kyona kyona; shana kawakunkolera oti: Nshube ndise obuhyo bwawe, mbulinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onjubure kir'eki mburabemu bwona, nshororemu buli kataama aka ibamba na kitondo n'akalikwiragura, mara n'omu mburabuzi nshororemu ibamba na kitondo. Ezab'ezo nizo ziraba mperwa yange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho obwesigwa bwange bulinjulira ahanyuma orwo olija kuleba emperwa yange. Buli emoi eliba etali ibamba na kitondo omu mbuzi anga etalikwiragura mu ntaama, k'elishangwa nanye eliba eli nyibano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani agamba ati, “Kurungi! Bibe nk'okwo wagamba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kir'ekyo Labani wenene ashororamu empaya za ibamba na kitondo n'emburabuzi zona ez'obutondatondo na kitondo, na buli emoi eyabaire eina eibara lilikwera, na buli kataama akabaire nikairagura azikwasa batabanibe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agya harai na Yakobo orugendo rw'ebiro bishatu. Obuhyo obwasigaireho Yakobo aba nibwo amulisiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akwata obuti bubisi bw'emilubuna, n'obw'emilozi, n'obw'emyaramoni; abushushuburamu enjuru zilikwera, ahalikwera haboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuti obwo yashushubwire abuteka omu maisho g'amahyo omu nyato z'amaizi mbali amahyo ganyweraga, kuba kagaijaga kunywa nirwo gayemaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho gemya gemire omu maisho g'obuti obwo, nikwo kuzara ez'obutondatondo na kitondo na ibamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ashorora obutama, kandi amahyo agalebesa ez'obutondatondo n'ezilikwiragura zona omu buhyo bwa Labani. Amahyo age agata aha rubaju mara tiyagateranisize na ga Labani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli orwo ezina amani omu buhyo zayemyaga, abyamika obuti omu nyato z'amaizi omu maizi g'obuhyo gabone kwemeza omu buti obwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ezitaina mani omu buhyo tiyaziteragamu buti; kityo ezitaina mani ziba za Labani, eziina amani za wenene Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo omushaija yatungire atyo akaganagana, akagira amahyo gahango, abairu n'abazana, engamia n'endogobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
